{"quest":"Ernest the Chicken","character":"Professor Oddenstein","text":"Ah Ernest, top notch bloke. He's helping me with my experiments.","uri":"a467daa62215bf1cfd3f54aa748a2227.mp3"}
{"quest":"Ernest the Chicken","character":"Professor Oddenstein","text":"Be careful in here, there's lots of dangerous equipment.","uri":"79cfa8e4479dd6a9baffa1e0390a31b9.mp3"}
{"quest":"Ernest the Chicken","character":"Professor Oddenstein","text":"Give 'em here then.","uri":"d3c42f57056f808c2d0dae4c55438054.mp3"}
