{"quest":"Ernest the Chicken","character":"Professor Oddenstein","text":"I need a rubber tube, a pressure gauge and a can of oil. Then your friend can stop being a chicken.","uri":"587355dded96fdb5258677e7335ac1c0.mp3"}
{"quest":"Ernest the Chicken","character":"Professor Oddenstein","text":"I'm missing the pressure gauge and a rubber tube. They've also taken my oil can, which I'm going to need to get this thing started again.","uri":"611a80c4ee269f7ccde053b4296f9820.mp3"}
{"quest":"Ernest the Chicken","character":"Professor Oddenstein","text":"It has also spent time as a time travel machine, and a dramatic lightning generator, and a thing for generating monsters.","uri":"e5badc8986b28cc5a1f1de2976a69a27.mp3"}
{"quest":"Ernest the Chicken","character":"Professor Oddenstein","text":"It was originally going to be called a transmutation machine. But after testing pouletmorph seems more appropriate.","uri":"1867f3181b3a4775c097cc0b5cbf73c5.mp3"}
{"quest":"Ernest the Chicken","character":"Professor Oddenstein","text":"It's a good start, but I'll need my oil can and rubber tube too.","uri":"5031a8ac55f371c0f08fbfa8327c9dcf.mp3"}
{"quest":"Ernest the Chicken","character":"Professor Oddenstein","text":"My machine is broken, and the house gremlins have run off with some vital bits.","uri":"6fb83557bcffaaf35bce536093e27d05.mp3"}
{"quest":"Ernest the Chicken","character":"Professor Oddenstein","text":"No, I'm just one of the tenants. It belongs to the count who lives in the basement.","uri":"c8402bae9e0830d228ee153c0a29d53f.mp3"}
{"quest":"Ernest the Chicken","character":"Professor Oddenstein","text":"Nothing at the moment... It's broken. It's meant to be a transmutation machine.","uri":"b71be2c41ecd20cf9c1063b18724ecde.mp3"}
{"quest":"Ernest the Chicken","character":"Professor Oddenstein","text":"Oh, he isn't normally a chicken, or at least he wasn't until he helped me test my pouletmorph machine.","uri":"eecd367b6e7587156d9c2f15f8bac3a9.mp3"}
{"quest":"Ernest the Chicken","character":"Professor Oddenstein","text":"Ooh I dunno. She could have free eggs for breakfast.","uri":"f4713a81dc37ba27ddb0f845f41bfd09.mp3"}
{"quest":"Ernest the Chicken","character":"Professor Oddenstein","text":"That would be a help. They'll be somewhere in the manor house or its grounds, the gremlins never get further than the entrance gate.","uri":"7a7beecb1e91e0c01d4d0a44f21284c1.mp3"}
{"quest":"Ernest the Chicken","character":"Professor Oddenstein","text":"Umm... It's not so easy...","uri":"40f7e35524f6ffdeea809cd5220064ba.mp3"}
{"quest":"Ernest the Chicken","character":"Professor Oddenstein","text":"Who's Veronica?","uri":"48b01c10b64cdda2346250829190232d.mp3"}
{"quest":"Ernest the Chicken","character":"Veronica","text":"Can you please help me? I'm in a terrible spot of trouble.","uri":"3c3d8b7d0184d4ef925eecb93c923087.mp3"}
{"quest":"Ernest the Chicken","character":"Veronica","text":"Eeeeeek!","uri":"3bb1322a4cb43b85831ad9c08a436e34.mp3"}
{"quest":"Ernest the Chicken","character":"Veronica","text":"Have you found my sweetheart yet?","uri":"360809616937e6176794560286063b51.mp3"}
{"quest":"Ernest the Chicken","character":"Veronica","text":"I know he's not exactly brave but I think you're being a bit harsh.","uri":"1cab7863c0f195013226f15eb1ab7aae.mp3"}
{"quest":"Ernest the Chicken","character":"Veronica","text":"My poor darling, why must these things happen to us.","uri":"82acaedf194d5d0101fc4f3f7884ecf8.mp3"}
{"quest":"Ernest the Chicken","character":"Veronica","text":"Oooh, you violent person you.","uri":"cd3ad9092c732063029afd49acb34b51.mp3"}
{"quest":"Ernest the Chicken","character":"Veronica","text":"Seeing as we were a little lost Ernest decided to go in and ask for directions.","uri":"d5aaba25be8cfb8a7cb55381c196281c.mp3"}
{"quest":"Ernest the Chicken","character":"Veronica","text":"Thank you, thank you. I'm very grateful.","uri":"3a5e1e71a5b920b7a6dd923056e5b3d7.mp3"}
{"quest":"Ernest the Chicken","character":"Veronica","text":"That was an hour ago. That house looks spooky, can you go and see if you can find him for me?","uri":"e681b37c3a892df9019b83e084593472.mp3"}
{"quest":"Ernest the Chicken","character":"Veronica","text":"Well be quick, I'm sure being a chicken can't be good for him.","uri":"68583caa643daa10bd6c2489001ffd5b.mp3"}
{"quest":"Ernest the Chicken","character":"Veronica","text":"Yes yes, I suppose it is a quest. My fiance Ernest and I came upon this house.","uri":"5ca162159f195bbf71d59c2bdbccb4f2.mp3"}
